text  203,144  Move taiko.rs maps out of osu!'s Songs folder?
text  203,178  2 taiko.rs sets (4 KB) are in osu!'s Songs folder, where osu! lists them as its own.
text  208,200  They go to the taiko.rs maps folder. Scores, replays and favourites stay.
text  203,216  osu!'s own sets stay where they are. Settings > Library can move them back.
text  325,236  Close osu! first for a clean move.
text  340,284  Not now
text  471,284  Move
text  310,324  Left/Right choose   Enter   Esc not now
